iig-port - portable DriverKit IIG generator

This is a cross-platform reimplementation of Apple's DriverKit iig host tool,
intended to generate headers and implementation sources from public XNU
DriverKit .iig inputs.

The implementation is based on observing the macOS Xcode 26.3 iig
(DriverKit-440) tool's output for different inputs, not on reverse engineering.
Its behavior is not equivalent to Xcode iig, including error messages and other
details that are difficult to replicate without reverse engineering.

Build:

    c++ -std=c++17 $(llvm-config --cxxflags --ldflags) iig.cpp -lclang -o iig

Test:

    tests/run.sh
